{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">CREATE SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309174","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">CREATE SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Creates an instance of a SOAP-header-entryref\nobject dynamically at run time, and assigns its handle to the specified\nhandle variable. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement__syntax_GC15AX2684046\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d375820e101\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement__idGDG23E2664791\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>CREATE SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF <var class=\"keyword varname\">hshEntry</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> IN WIDGET-POOL <var class=\"keyword varname\">widget-pool-name</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">hshEntry</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A variable of type HANDLE that represents the handle of the SOAP-header-entryref\nobject.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">IN WIDGET-POOL <var class=\"keyword varname\">widget-pool-name </var></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">An expression of type CHARACTER that evaluates to the name of the\nwidget pool in which the dynamic SOAP-header-entryref object is created.\nA SOAP-header-entryref object is created in the closest unnamed widget-pool,\nby default.<div class=\"note note note_note\"><span class=\"note__title\">Note:</span> Widget pool names are not case-sensitive.</div></dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement__notes_GC15AY2684056\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d375820e166\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">The SOAP-header-entryref\nobject is explicitly created by the application using the CREATE\nSOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF statement. The application is responsible for\ndeleting this object. Use the DELETE OBJECT statement to delete\na SOAP-header-entryref object without deleting its underlying XML.\nUse the DELETE-HEADER-ENTRY() method to delete the XML underlying\nthe SOAP-header-entryref object without deleting the object.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement__see-also_GC15AZ2684060\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d375820e175\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SOAP-header-entryref-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SOAP-header-entryref-object-handle.html\">SOAP-header-entryref object handle</a>\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-statement.html\">CREATE SOAP-HEADER statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"CREATE-SOCKET-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SOCKET-statement.html\">CREATE SOCKET statement</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309174","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"CREATE SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/CREATE-SOAP-HEADER-ENTRYREF-statement.html","type":"Manual"}